From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 08:56:35 -0647
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: google,zumapro: Add the camera clocks

CMU_TOP also makes the four camera sensor master clocks (CIS_CLK0 to
CIS_CLK3) and the camera front end's NoC clock. Add each one's mux, gate
and divider at the end of the TOP block, leaving the existing
identifiers unchanged.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/google-modules/soc/gs/+/204078758737776959ecc85c527a00fd2cabb62f/drivers/soc/google/cal-if/zuma/cmucal-node.c
Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../bindings/clock/google,zumapro-clock.yaml      |  4 +++-
 include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h        | 15 +++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/google,zumapro-clock.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/google,zumapro-clock.yaml
index 8d35f89f4..f71b12f3e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/google,zumapro-clock.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/google,zumapro-clock.yaml
@@ -11,7 +11,9 @@ maintainers:
 
 description: |
   CMU_TOP supplies the NoC and UFS clock paths to CMU_HSI2 and the supply-GPIO
-  path in CMU_PERIC0. CMU_TOP also provides the HSI0 parent rate paths.
+  path in CMU_PERIC0. CMU_TOP also provides the HSI0 parent rate paths, the
+  four camera sensor master clocks (CIS_CLK0-3) and the camera front end's
+  NoC clock.
   CMU_MISC supplies the firmware-owned watchdog bus clock paths.
   CMU_PERIC0 supplies its GPIO bank and USI2-USI6 (the cameras' and the
   battery's I2C buses), the USIs from CMU_TOP's optional PERIC0 IP clock.
diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h b/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h
index 658bf01f8..972d9c9f5 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h
@@ -59,6 +59,21 @@
 #define CLK_MOUT_PERIC0_IP		53
 #define CLK_GOUT_PERIC0_IP		54
 #define CLK_DOUT_PERIC0_IP		55
+#define CLK_MOUT_CIS_CLK0		56
+#define CLK_GOUT_CIS_CLK0		57
+#define CLK_DOUT_CIS_CLK0		58
+#define CLK_MOUT_CIS_CLK1		59
+#define CLK_GOUT_CIS_CLK1		60
+#define CLK_DOUT_CIS_CLK1		61
+#define CLK_MOUT_CIS_CLK2		62
+#define CLK_GOUT_CIS_CLK2		63
+#define CLK_DOUT_CIS_CLK2		64
+#define CLK_MOUT_CIS_CLK3		65
+#define CLK_GOUT_CIS_CLK3		66
+#define CLK_DOUT_CIS_CLK3		67
+#define CLK_MOUT_ISPFE_NOC		68
+#define CLK_GOUT_ISPFE_NOC		69
+#define CLK_DOUT_ISPFE_NOC		70
 
 /* CMU_HSI0. */
 #define CLK_FOUT_HSI0_USB		1
